hm1092: quiet the kernel log, drop the sysfs stream switch

The driver comes from a debugging effort and logged about 15 lines per
stream-on/off at info level, plus a warning that intel_cvs does not export
cvs_send_mipi_ir_config (it never does in-tree; that call is for laptops
whose IR sensor sits behind the CVS bridge, which is not the case here).
Turn these into debug messages (dyndbg can bring them back), and remove the
diagnostic /sys/.../stream attribute that started the sensor behind the
V4L2 pipeline's back.

